==Danish==
[[File:Åbningstider, Stadsbiblioteket i Lyngby, 2016-04-17.JPG|thumb|"Mandag". Opening hours for a Danish library displayed on a window with "Mandag" near the top.]]

===Etymology===
From {{der|da|gmq-oda|mandagh}}, from {{der|da|non|mánadagr}}, from late {{der|da|gmw-pro|*mānini dag}}, a calque of Latin {{m|la|dies lunae}}. Compare {{cog|nb|mandag}}, Swedish and {{cog|nn|måndag}}, {{cog|is|mánudagur}}, {{cog|fo|mánadagur}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|da|/ˈmanˀda/|[ˈmænˀdæ]}}
* {{rhymes|da|a}}

