==Dutch==

===Etymology===
Equivalent to {{compound|nl|man|dag|t1=man|t2=day}}.

===Noun===
{{nl-noun|m|-en|mandagje}}

# (unit of measurement) one day of labour by one person; a [[man-day]]
#: {{syn|nl|persoonsdag}}

====Usage notes====
